{
"file": 184,
"paths": [
"d007/d007/f077"
],
"lines": [
{
"n": 0,
"h": "4943d7c9",
"en_raw": "Because of that, Karugane Elementary"
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "9a1aad54",
"en_raw": "went to group commuting, they say"
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "f733752b",
"en_raw": "We might get gulped"
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "6ac362e7",
"en_raw": "right down"
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "d76f1af7",
"en_raw": "Nishi, I'm scared!"
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "7f780555",
"en_raw": "Please, just this once"
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "bf5489b3",
"en_raw": "But I go home a different way"
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "26ddf767",
"en_raw": "Um, I have to..."
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "5d467f19",
"en_raw": "Sorry"
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "b02144b7",
"en_raw": "Sorry, Nishi"
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "3d7f406c",
"en_raw": "Got a minute?"
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "c962f24b",
"en_raw": "Oh, Murase"
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "80c8f13b",
"en_raw": "It's Nishi"
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "fe652f19",
"en_raw": "But he's kind of"
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "d0b373ff",
"en_raw": "hard to talk to..."
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "6cb4eb3b",
"en_raw": "Hey, Murase"
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "c06b094c",
"en_raw": "...Oh, sorry"
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "9c01226b",
"en_raw": "Did I interrupt?"
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "e6e78f6b",
"en_raw": "By the way, Murase"
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "c3210c26",
"en_raw": "do you know the Black Dog?"
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "dddb1841",
"en_raw": "Black Dog...?"
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "65152ea7",
"en_raw": "Yeah, a huge stray dog"
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "3d78c845",
"en_raw": "appears around"
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "b33f8e57",
"en_raw": "Karugane"
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "37d44632",
"en_raw": "That's my way home"
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "3898f664",
"en_raw": "It'd be reassuring if Nishi"
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "1609632e",
"en_raw": "walked home with me"
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "1023c86d",
"en_raw": "So that's what it was"
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "a5149496",
"en_raw": "But since it's a big dog"
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "adc545ae",
"en_raw": "it doesn't necessarily bite"
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "40e61a90",
"en_raw": "My Melos is gentle"
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "ad790f35",
"en_raw": "But that black dog"
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "0067cbd5",
"en_raw": "has rabies"
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "8b5d4e77",
"en_raw": "If it bites you, you go crazy"
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "f55a9142",
"en_raw": "and thrash around"
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "818c0517",
"en_raw": "and foam at the mouth and die"
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "52648fb3",
"en_raw": "That's terrible..."
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "e223c8f2",
"en_raw": "Honestly"
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "b2a0e2b1",
"en_raw": "what's this story about..."
},
{
"n": 39,
"h": "9e54d469",
"en_raw": "Oh, Yamazaki"
},
{
"n": 40,
"h": "c9b7d11b",
"en_raw": "Yamazaki, do you know"
},
{
"n": 41,
"h": "a12513b4",
"en_raw": "anything about the stray dog?"
},
{
"n": 42,
"h": "7d245da7",
"en_raw": "I don't know the rumor"
},
{
"n": 43,
"h": "7901028c",
"en_raw": "but I know about rabies"
},
{
"n": 44,
"h": "aa6620b3",
"en_raw": "But rabies isn't"
},
{
"n": 45,
"h": "ff86d5bf",
"en_raw": "a common disease"
},
{
"n": 46,
"h": "26d0903a",
"en_raw": "It makes you die, right?"
},
{
"n": 47,
"h": "c8731a76",
"en_raw": "First, drinking water becomes difficult"
},
{
"n": 48,
"h": "b5988ad7",
"en_raw": "movement"
},
{
"n": 50,
"h": "c394e9f1",
"en_raw": "leading to coma"
},
{
"n": 51,
"h": "a8b2fc23",
"en_raw": "and then death"
},
{
"n": 52,
"h": "5f7f3a88",
"en_raw": "So you do die"
},
{
"n": 53,
"h": "6bcae0eb",
"en_raw": "...Listen to the end"
},
{
"n": 54,
"h": "86ede8f4",
"en_raw": "Dying, yes, but only if you catch it"
},
{
"n": 55,
"h": "096a8cc0",
"en_raw": "...Well, never mind"
},
{
"n": 56,
"h": "7ab0383d",
"en_raw": "Stay and listen"
},
{
"n": 57,
"h": "bf31eb76",
"en_raw": "As symptoms of rabies"
},
{
"n": 58,
"h": "c8731a76",
"en_raw": "First, drinking water becomes difficult"
},
{
"n": 59,
"h": "b5988ad7",
"en_raw": "movement"
},
{
"n": 61,
"h": "c394e9f1",
"en_raw": "leading to coma"
},
{
"n": 62,
"h": "a8b2fc23",
"en_raw": "and then death"
},
{
"n": 63,
"h": "dc0030c9",
"en_raw": "...You're right"
},
{
"n": 64,
"h": "aa6620b3",
"en_raw": "But rabies isn't"
},
{
"n": 65,
"h": "2ccdcc53",
"en_raw": "It isn't a common disease"
},
{
"n": 66,
"h": "9fb28b20",
"en_raw": "There's a vaccine now"
},
{
"n": 67,
"h": "155db6cb",
"en_raw": "and above all, no cases"
},
{
"n": 68,
"h": "e5d2c737",
"en_raw": "have been confirmed in over 40 years"
},
{
"n": 69,
"h": "9f555831",
"en_raw": "In other words, it no longer exists"
},
{
"n": 70,
"h": "c5a3386f",
"en_raw": "in Japan"
},
{
"n": 71,
"h": "0fbd2eff",
"en_raw": "Hmm~"
},
{
"n": 72,
"h": "0105cbaa",
"en_raw": "Hearing the class rep's talk"
},
{
"n": 73,
"h": "32604a1f",
"en_raw": "did you feel a little reassured?"
},
{
"n": 74,
"h": "ac7581d5",
"en_raw": "...Not at all!"
},
{
"n": 75,
"h": "4cf36e24",
"en_raw": "Even if you say that"
},
{
"n": 76,
"h": "fc4205f8",
"en_raw": "scary things are scary"
},
{
"n": 77,
"h": "84349b2a",
"en_raw": "Hey Nishi, walk home with me"
},
{
"n": 78,
"h": "98838997",
"en_raw": "Oh, right, Yamazaki"
},
{
"n": 79,
"h": "7d4f7f5c",
"en_raw": "you go that way home, right?"
},
{
"n": 80,
"h": "d8a205cf",
"en_raw": "Why not walk her home"
},
{
"n": 81,
"h": "6e2eb9cb",
"en_raw": "Whaaat~"
},
{
"n": 82,
"h": "a198a2c2",
"en_raw": "Obtained the rumor of the Black Dog..."
},
{
"n": 83,
"h": "c2ddc952",
"en_raw": "Hey, Yamazaki..."
},
{
"n": 84,
"h": "e9c24f59",
"en_raw": "Murase seems reassured"
},
{
"n": 85,
"h": "cc5228ae",
"en_raw": "See, it's fine"
},
{
"n": 86,
"h": "ad49992d",
"en_raw": "About what we were saying..."
},
{
"n": 87,
"h": "787adfed",
"en_raw": "I'm going to"
},
{
"n": 88,
"h": "75e0fda2",
"en_raw": "avoid the Karugane Elementary area"
},
{
"n": 89,
"h": "9a450b8e",
"en_raw": "for a while"
},
{
"n": 90,
"h": "81ff5d46",
"en_raw": "It's all Nishi's fault!"
},
{
"n": 91,
"h": "c8d7f513",
"en_raw": "Oh, Yamazaki"
},
{
"n": 92,
"h": "00f8dcd3",
"en_raw": "Oh, Murase"
},
{
"n": 93,
"h": "c3f05a92",
"en_raw": "It's noisy here"
},
{
"n": 94,
"h": "713a21b6",
"en_raw": "and it irritates me..."
}
]
}